 r←Test_Server_422(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;html
⍝ Ask for the home page of a group and for its edit form; pretends to be a Browser
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 html←∆GetHtmlFromServer'[localhost]/v1/group-homepage?name=aplteam'
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<h2>aplteam <span class="page-sub">'⍷html
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<form action="group-homepage-edit">'⍷html
 html←∆GetHtmlFromServer'[localhost]/v1/group-homepage-edit?name=aplteam'
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<form id="create-group-homepage"'⍷html
 →T.PassesIf∨/'name="content"'⍷html

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
